{
  "post": {
    "id": "7195372",
    "published": "2016-06-10T11:02:24.000Z",
    "title": "ご報告。",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/7195372.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160611074456/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/7195372.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "7月8日から放送開始のTVアニメ「ねじ巻き精霊戦記  天鏡のアルデラミン」のED主題歌を私、鹿乃が担当させていただくことになりました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我鹿乃确定要为7月8日起开播的电视动画《发条精灵战记 天镜的极北之星》演唱片尾主题曲了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I, Kano, will be performing the ending theme of the TV anime \"Nejimaki Seirei Senki: Tenkyou no Alderamin\" (Alderamin on the Sky), which starts airing on July 8."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "作曲編曲はTom-h@ckさん！歌詞は鹿乃が担当させていただいています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "作曲和编曲由 Tom-h@ck 老师负责！歌词则是由鹿乃来写的。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The music and arrangement are by Tom-h@ck! The lyrics are by Kano."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そんな楽曲のタイトルは「nameless」で……2016年９月7日にリリースが決まりました⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这首歌的歌名叫《nameless》……已经确定将于2016年9月7日发售啦⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The title of the song is \"nameless\", and its release has been set for September 7, 2016⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "youtube",
        "videoId": "5kL47t4Mz-4",
        "watch": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5kL47t4Mz-4",
        "video": "7a460f9f936d.mp4",
        "cover": "fb9213b3f9ec.jpg",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160611074456/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5kL47t4Mz-4",
        "coverSource": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5kL47t4Mz-4/hqdefault.jpg"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "どんな楽曲になるのか、わくわくそわそわ、アニメの放送と一緒に楽しみに待っていてくださると嬉しいです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这首歌会是什么样呢？我既兴奋又忐忑。希望大家能和动画开播一起期待它的到来，我会很开心的。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm all excited and fidgety about how the song will turn out, and I'd be happy if you'd look forward to it along with the anime's broadcast."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "詳しい放送日などはこちらの公式HPをチェックしてください！"
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://alderamin.net/",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "http://alderamin.net"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "具体的播出时间等信息，请查看这边的官方网站确认！"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "http://alderamin.net/",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "http://alderamin.net"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please check the official website for details such as the broadcast dates! "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "http://alderamin.net/",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "http://alderamin.net"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "よかったらこのブログを #アルデラミン のハッシュタグつきでTwitterなどでも拡散してください。いっぱいの人に知っていただきたいのです。図々しいお願いしてごめんなさい。なにとぞご協力を〜〜（＞人＜）汗"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "如果方便的话，请把这个博客配上“#アルデラミン”的标签，在 Twitter 等处帮忙扩散。我想让更多人都知道它。这么厚脸皮的请求真不好意思，恳请大家多多帮忙～～（＞人＜）汗"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you like, please spread this blog post on Twitter and elsewhere with the hashtag #アルデラミン . I want lots of people to know about it. Sorry for the pushy request. Please, I'm counting on your help~~ (＞人＜) sweat"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2016年前半戦も残り僅か…"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2016年的上半场也没剩多少了……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The first half of 2016 is almost over..."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まだまだ休ませませんよ〜一緒に目一杯楽しんでいきましょう！いっぱい心配をおかけしちゃうかもですが、コツコツと鹿乃のペースで必ず乗り越えて進んでいくのでついてきてください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我可不会让大家歇着哦～让我们一起尽情享受吧！虽然可能会让大家担心不少，但我会按自己的节奏脚踏实地、一步一个脚印地克服困难继续前进，请你们跟紧我。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm not going to let myself rest yet~ Let's enjoy it to the fullest together! I may worry you a lot, but I'll steadily, at Kano's own pace, make it through and keep going without fail, so please stay with me."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まずはライブですね！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "首先要说的就是演唱会！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "First up is the live, of course! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ひゃ〜〜緊張だようっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "呀～～好紧张啊！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Eeek, I'm nervous!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
